  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.6.0-rc.2\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\nParallell and user delegated signing release candidate 2. For more information see [concepts - signing](https://docs.altinn.studio/altinn-studio/concepts/signing/) and [developer guides](https://docs.altinn.studio/altinn-studio/guides/development/signing/).\n### New Features 🎉\n* Feature/signing by @HauklandJ in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/956\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* Fix null pointer exception in obsolete single data element validation by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1309\n* ITranslationService don't throw on missing text resource by @bjosttveit in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1313\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.6.0-rc.1...v8.6.0-rc.2",
